sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Workload owner
    participant W as Grove or scheduler
    participant G as Group controller
    participant A0 as Node agent rank 0
    participant A1 as Node agent rank 1

    O->>W: Request the complete target Pod set
    W-->>O: Create target Pods while scheduling proceeds
    O->>G: Create PodSetRestore with Pod UIDs and container mappings
    G->>G: Create PodRestore leaves in WaitingForPlaceholder
    G->>G: Wait for every target placeholder
    G->>G: Build and validate profile-required identity data
    par Admit PodRestore rank 0
        G->>A0: Preflight with required set context
        A0-->>G: Admitted or Refused
    and Admit PodRestore rank 1
        G->>A1: Preflight with required set context
        A1-->>G: Admitted or Refused
    end
    alt A target misses the deadline or any member refuses
        G-->>O: PodSetRestore Failed before reconstruction
    else Every member is Admitted
        par Restore rank 0
            G->>A0: Activate restore
        and Restore rank 1
            G->>A1: Activate restore
        end
        alt Communicator reconstruction profile
            A0-->>G: Restored True or terminal failure
            A1-->>G: Restored True or terminal failure
        else Preserved-session profile
            A0-->>G: Prepared or terminal failure
            A1-->>G: Prepared or terminal failure
            G->>G: Require every member Prepared
            G->>A0: Authorize release
            G->>A1: Authorize release
            A0-->>G: Restored True
            A1-->>G: Restored True
        end
        alt Every member reports Restored True
            G-->>O: PodSetRestore Ready
            O->>O: Observe Pod readiness before serving
        else Any member reports terminal failure
            G-->>O: PodSetRestore Failed with every member outcome
            Note over O,G: The workload owner chooses recovery
        end
    end
